{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Staraway is a narrative-centric adventure about finding yourself in a weird little universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Travel the stars!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your telescope to warp to distant star systems. Chart the night sky with constellations you find and stars you visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076330/extras/starexample.gif?t=1744847877\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore tiny planets!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop between bite-sized moons, asteroids, and planets. The world is always set in motion with (sometimes unusual) orbital patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076330/extras/planetexample.gif?t=1744847877\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Is everything okay?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Staraway is a short story about struggling with a strange dissonance, going through changes, and finding your way home. You won't make the journey alone, though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076330/extras/conversation.png?t=1744847877\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Chill vibes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to a (mostly) calming electronic soundtrack that scores the story and intertwines with the world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3076330?t=1744847877","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744847877","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076330/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744847877","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076330/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744847877","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Staraway is a narrative-centric adventure about finding yourself in a weird little universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Travel the stars!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your telescope to warp to distant star systems. Chart the night sky with constellations you find and stars you visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076330/extras/starexample.gif?t=1744847877\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore tiny planets!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop between bite-sized moons, asteroids, and planets. The world is always set in motion with (sometimes unusual) orbital patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076330/extras/planetexample.gif?t=1744847877\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Is everything okay?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Staraway is a short story about struggling with a strange dissonance, going through changes, and finding your way home. You won't make the journey alone, though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076330/extras/conversation.png?t=1744847877\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Chill vibes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to a (mostly) calming electronic soundtrack that scores the story and intertwines with the world.</p>","developers":["Greenpixel"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3